WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:05.600
MachinePulseAI is an engineering analysis
platform developed for test and R&D teams.

2
00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:11.110
It brings recorded measurements, analysis
tools and results into one workspace.

3
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:17.290
Import measurement files, organize channels
and prepare signals for analysis.

4
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:24.810
Compare frequency, vibration and structural
results in interactive plots.

5
00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:31.450
Bring findings, plots and analysis settings
together in shareable engineering reports.

6
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:38.400
The optional AI assistant can explain methods
and help carry out your chosen analysis steps.

7
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:45.680
Choose supported cloud or compatible local
models, and the modules your workflow needs.
